  "referenceNumber": "CAF0029",
  "remarks": "\nThe Officer’s Union for International Security is an involved person under the Central African Republic (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2020 as it is or has been a member of, or associated with, a person who has been involved in a relevant activity, the Wagner Group. The Wagner Group is or has been an involved person since it is or has engaged in a relevant activity namely the commission of violations of international humanitarian law in the Central African Republic including the deliberate targeting of civilians.\n",
